# LaTeX build artifacts.
#
# Course PDFs are compiled in place in these folders, which scatters auxiliary
# files through public/. Those should not be committed.
#
# The .tex sources MUST stay tracked: course syllabi tell students they can find
# the source for any .pdf on the site by changing the suffix to .tex, so the
# sources are published deliberately, not by accident.

*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.dvi
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.nav
*.out
*.run.xml
*.snm
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.vrb
*.xdv

# Never ignore the published sources or output.
!*.tex
!*.pdf
